{
  "id": "ss.char.blok",
  "name": "Blok",
  "description": "Sealed survivor in a squared-off shell with a riveted seam — the heaviest plating of the eight, and the same dead organ under it. Nothing about the armour helps: the hive isn't looking for a shape, it's listening for a signal that never comes.",
  "tags": ["ss-char"],
  "size": [32, 32],
  "meta": { "radius": 12 },
  "parts": [
